WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.803 --> 00:00:03.737
Here's my real question,

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:04.705
if you really want it,

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:06.047
and by the way,
you get to choose

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:08.509
your work-life balance
but that's on you.

00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:10.477
That's not me to 
choose or anybody else.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:11.845
What I'm passionate 
about, Steven,

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.846
to be very frank with you is

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:13.754
what did you do from

00:00:13.754 --> 00:00:17.084
Friday 5 P.M. 
until Monday 7 A.M.?

00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:18.685
I'm just curious and

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.954
I don't think you 
shouldn't have a weekend

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:24.458
but I think everybody's ambition
actually is more predicated

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.026
on their actions 
than their words.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.295
My friends tell me all the 
time they're so ambitious

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:30.383
and I'm like if that's true

00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:32.833
then you punt leisure

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:37.170
and you punt concerts at 
Jones Beach and you work.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.815
(rap music)

